# Example: test_dict.wcn

## Schema

```
Main = Config Config2

Config = {String : Int}/settings
BuildType = "Dev" | "Local" | "Deploy"
Config2 = {BuildType : String}/environments
```

## Construction

```
[:Main [:Config [:Map/{String:Int} "0":0 "1":1]] [:Config2 [:Map/{BuildType:String} Dev:"dev" Local:"local" Deploy:"deploy"]]]
```
